{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0483_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ff07c1186386e8a5414dcf52b41377c52833b115f493edc8560ba75707128521", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌『アイグラ！！』の撮影だ。\n瑞希が挑むテーマは『パジャマパーティー』！）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄写真杂志《偶像写真！！》。\n瑞希要挑战的主题是“睡衣派对”！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0483_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "ec6c247e006c0f97ac9e6fb516b3d2ccb85c5f88f2a72ce830fc3f8b0deb2a13", "ja": "このパジャマにぴったりな、ふわふわな気分……。\nふかふかな羽毛を使った手品、わくわくするお話……。", "zh": "和这套睡衣相称的，软绵绵的心情……\n用松软羽毛表演的魔术，还有令人期待的故事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0483_1002_p", "source_sha256": "9cb59c69f60721fd083b7657c3d3cd7474a8b190f182c58199b3ec83edb7e3d3", "ja": "（なんだか声を掛けづらい雰囲気だな……。\nちょっと様子を見守ってみるか）", "zh": "（感觉不太好开口搭话啊……先在旁边观察一下吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0483_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "e8b27c345324212ca59c6539adb222cad56a68e5aa252aed209a1d5ba580274e", "ja": "うん、準備はばっちり。今日のパーティーは\n盛り上がること間違いなし。さすがだぞ、瑞希。", "zh": "嗯，准备得很充分。今天的派对肯定会热闹起来。真不愧是瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0483_1004_p", "source_sha256": "83d8217321d23d0af5faa8532b0f228b2c3c857d8c28503f3da0251f6dcae3e4", "ja": "おお。気合い十分だな、瑞希。", "zh": "哦，干劲十足啊，瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0483_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "def559c18bc5dc08ccf1f46722d4201862d4b9f168f4ba91a4e50e3e13937e54", "ja": "{$P$}、いつからそこに？\n盗み聞きとは……。私、変なこと言ってませんよね？", "zh": "{$P$}，你什么时候在那里的？\n偷听什么的……我没说什么奇怪的话吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0483_1006_p", "source_sha256": "9a8aae99312b4627335c4a86ee0cab1b7e7251df36a6de33d9e1e2ac6a396414", "ja": "ああ、全然。瑞希とパジャマパーティーをしたら\nすごく盛り上がりそうだなと思ったよ。", "zh": "啊，完全没有。我只是觉得，要是和真壁瑞希办一场睡衣派对，肯定会热闹极了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0483_1007_044miz", "source_sha256": "080717f4ee91908cf5e8eb61c360ca64de87e56b489b9c5d0c1c5959b02f3c34", "ja": "はい。きっと見た人は必ず捧腹絶倒。\n眠気は吹き飛び、オールナイトなパーティーを……。", "zh": "是的。看到的人一定会捧腹大笑。睡意也会一扫而空，来一场通宵派对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0483_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "d80be2322031947b867cb914fd057ecf333b653a59bc7e7f444b00f55438e9d1", "ja": "{$P$}……\n私は重大な過ちを犯してしまったかもしれません。", "zh": "{$P$}……\n我可能犯下了一个严重的错误。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0483_1009_p", "source_sha256": "9d0676a94fce4e9e0bc10ef7f0cdb9f7fd1269d2215464bb4dfb9354eb7f56a8", "ja": "えっ？　どうしたんだ……？", "zh": "咦？这是怎么了……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0483_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "8895ee3f64675a0a6f394ee995c614b5780c8a45f8523f818e8ffea6dda3448e", "ja": "私はパーティーという単語に囚われ、\nみんなが楽しめることばかり考えてきました。", "zh": "我被“派对”这个词困住了，一直只想着要让大家都开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0483_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "f5b44f54a7119e7ae19be753fd91989d2c837a8e04f4856faacd7efedb2897e8", "ja": "ですが、パーティーとはいえパジャマ……\nそう、寝るためのパーティーなのです。", "zh": "不过，虽说是派对，但要穿睡衣……\n没错，是为了睡觉而举办的派对。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0483_1012_p", "source_sha256": "b3523c5b554768b0318fd9ee0db735486fe4a736d07554cd1cf842bc20ecb4f6", "ja": "なるほど……？", "zh": "原来如此……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0483_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "5dfb31a386a9bd3cf060d3adabe98dd6e4af5cc5609466f2db6b853bab2bbcb5", "ja": "私の計画では、みんなが眠れなくなってしまいます。\nいったい、どうしたら……。", "zh": "按照我的计划，大家都会睡不着的。到底该怎么办才好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0483_1014_p", "source_sha256": "924a4bf3f6909c4982b7e2102eec8d167666fcb391015dbb6376f20f5cf2beef", "ja": "心配しなくても大丈夫。パーティーを全力で楽しんだら\nきっと疲れて、熟睡できると思うんだ。", "zh": "不用担心，没事的。要是全力享受派对的话，\n我想肯定会玩累，然后熟睡的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0483_1015_044miz", "source_sha256": "ead79f0582fc5accfb55748949e42b9be2d19039bf97a10462181aaef874fe52", "ja": "確かに……一理ありますね。\nそう考えたら、ますます気合いが入ってきました。", "zh": "说得也是……有几分道理呢。\n这么一想，我更有干劲了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0483_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0483_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "361ee306b4b832ec6f503dd849d8a3e357a64f54e64e489a634c4a7032b2436b", "ja": "見た人達が、私と一緒にパーティーを楽しめる……\nそんな撮影にしてみせます。えいえい、おー！", "zh": "我要拍出让看到的人也能和我一起享受派对的作品……就是这样的拍摄。加油，加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
